{"product":{"id":8914149212385,"title":"OSKI 102","body_html":"<p>The Oski 102 is a full-steam freestyle powerhouse: a 102mm park and all-mountain twin engineered with Oscar Weary for his debut pro model.</p>\n<p>Built from a modified Jeffrey shape and tuned around Oscar’s skiing, the Oski pairs Ripper Rocker with a soft-yet-stout flex, a mount point 2cm behind center, and a Hybrid Sidecut with more symmetrical radii from tip to tail. The result is a rounder feel through forward and switch carves, better balance in the air, and harder carving when the ski is engaged. These fire-breathing locomotives stay on rails through every turn in any terrain. All aboard the Oski Express. The hype train has arrived.</p>\n<p>Every Oski 102 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon, our proprietary composite weave that improves strength and durability while decreasing weight. Add our 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing, and you have one of the most versatile and durable freestyle skis on the mountain.</p>","vendor":"ON3P Skis","product_type":"2026 Skis","created_at":"2025-04-28T13:29:39-07:00","handle":"oski-102","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","published_at":"2025-05-06T10:56:03-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Oski, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":46379259658465,"product_id":8914149212385,"title":"171cm","price":"799.00","sku":"27ON3POSKI102171","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"171cm","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2025-04-28T13:29:39-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":2,"old_inventory_quantity":2,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_pr